          {
            "title": "Question",
            "id": 114945,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Mengapa kita meneruskan sebuah fungsi sebagai parameter di dalam <code>.map()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Untuk memberi tahu fungsi <code>.map()</code> cara mengubah setiap elemen</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Untuk memberi tahu fungsi <code>.map()</code> array mana yang harus dimodifikasi</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Untuk memberi tahu fungsi <code>.map()</code> berapa banyak elemen yang ada di array pemanggil</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Untuk memberi tahu fungsi <code>.map()</code> cara mengubah setiap elemen.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kamu menjalankan <code>[2, 5].map(price =&gt; price * 2)</code>. Array baru mana yang dibuat?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>[4, 10]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>[2, 5]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>[true, true]</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>[7]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>[4, 10]</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example",
            "id": 114956,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kodekan pernyataan return yang mengonversi setiap jumlah jawaban benar (dari 60) menjadi persentase.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" correct = [\" /><text value=\"58\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"48\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"60\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"49\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"55\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" percentageScores = correct.map(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"element\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" element / \" /><text value=\"60\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(percentageScores);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"96\" endIndex=\"102\" /><option startIndex=\"103\" endIndex=\"110\" /><option startIndex=\"111\" endIndex=\"112\" /><option startIndex=\"113\" endIndex=\"115\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"index\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 0.9666666666666667, 0.8, 1, 0.8166666666666667, 0.9166666666666666 ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>return</code>, diikuti oleh <code>element</code>, lalu <code>/</code>, <code>60</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kodekan pernyataan return yang mengonversi setiap jumlah jawaban benar (dari 60) menjadi persentase.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" correct = [\" /><text value=\"58\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"48\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"60\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"49\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"55\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" percentageScores = correct.map(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"element\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" element / \" /><text value=\"60\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(percentageScores);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"96\" endIndex=\"102\" /><option startIndex=\"103\" endIndex=\"110\" /><option startIndex=\"111\" endIndex=\"112\" /><option startIndex=\"113\" endIndex=\"115\" /><option startIndex=\"75\" endIndex=\"83\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"let\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"const\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"async\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 0.9666666666666667, 0.8, 1, 0.8166666666666667, 0.9166666666666666 ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>function</code>, diikuti oleh <code>return</code>, <code>element</code>, <code>/</code>, dan terakhir <code>60</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example",
            "id": 115089,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Buat kode fungsi arrow yang menambahkan 10% ke setiap nilai dalam array <code>prices</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" prices = [\" /><text value=\"1.99\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2.49\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0.99\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"4.99\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" taxed = prices.map(\" /><text value=\"price\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" price * \" /><text value=\"1.1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(taxed);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"61\" /><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"65\" /><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option startIndex=\"72\" endIndex=\"73\" /><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"74\" /><option startIndex=\"75\" endIndex=\"86\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 2.189, 2.7390000000000003, 1.089, 5.489000000000001 ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>prices</code>, diikuti oleh <code>map</code>, lalu <code>price</code>, <code>=</code>, <code>&gt;</code>, <code>price * 1.1</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Buat kode fungsi arrow yang menambahkan 10% ke setiap nilai dalam array <code>prices</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" prices = [\" /><text value=\"1.99\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2.49\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0.99\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"4.99\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" taxed = prices.map(\" /><text value=\"price\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" price * \" /><text value=\"1.1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(taxed);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"61\" /><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"65\" /><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option startIndex=\"72\" endIndex=\"73\" /><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"74\" /><option startIndex=\"75\" endIndex=\"86\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"price * 0.1\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"price + 0.1\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"price * 0.9\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 2.189, 2.7390000000000003, 1.089, 5.489000000000001 ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>prices</code>, diikuti oleh <code>map</code>, <code>price</code>, <code>=</code>, <code>&gt;</code>, dan terakhir <code>price * 1.1</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question",
            "id": 114944,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa sintaks yang benar untuk memanggil <code>.map()</code> pada array bernama <code>fruits</code>.</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Nama array diikuti oleh <code>.map()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Fungsi <code>.map()</code> diikuti dengan nama array.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Fungsi <code>.map()</code> dengan nama array yang diteruskan sebagai parameter.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Nama array diikuti oleh <code>.map()</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kamu ingin <code>.map()</code> memproses array <code>fruits</code> dengan fungsi <code>rename</code>. Pemanggilan mana yang benar?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>fruits.map(rename)</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>map.fruits(rename)</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>map(fruits, rename)</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>rename.map(fruits)</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>fruits.map(rename)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example",
            "id": 114952,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Lengkapi sintaks untuk memanggil fungsi <code>.map()</code> pada array <code>numbers</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" numbers = [\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"31\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"42\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"73\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" evens = numbers.map(\" /><text value=\"element\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" (element % \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" == \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"));\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(evens);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"59\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ true, false, true, false ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>numbers.map</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question",
