            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Mengapa kita meneruskan fungsi sebagai parameter di dalam <code>.filter()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Untuk memberi tahu fungsi <code>.filter()</code> elemen mana yang akan disertakan atau dikecualikan dalam array baru</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Untuk memberi tahu fungsi <code>.filter()</code> array mana yang akan dimodifikasi</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Untuk memberi tahu fungsi <code>.filter()</code> cara memodifikasi setiap elemen</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Untuk memberi tahu fungsi <code>.filter()</code> elemen mana yang akan disertakan atau dikecualikan dalam array baru.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kamu menjalankan <code>[8, 10, 12].filter(score =&gt; score &gt;= 10)</code>. Array baru mana yang dibuat?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>[10, 12]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>[12]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>[false, true, true]</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>[8, 10, 12]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>[10, 12]</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question",
            "id": 115310,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa sintaks yang benar untuk memanggil <code>.filter()</code> pada array bernama <code>vegetables</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Nama array diikuti oleh <code>.filter()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Fungsi <code>.filter()</code> diikuti dengan nama array.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Fungsi <code>.filter()</code> dengan nama array yang diteruskan sebagai parameter</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Nama array diikuti oleh <code>.filter()</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kamu ingin <code>.filter()</code> memproses <code>vegetables</code> dengan fungsi <code>isFresh</code>. Pemanggilan mana yang benar?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>vegetables.filter(isFresh)</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>filter.vegetables(isFresh)</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>filter(vegetables, isFresh)</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>isFresh.filter(vegetables)</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>vegetables.filter(isFresh)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example",
            "id": 115316,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Lengkapi sintaks untuk memanggil fungsi <code>.filter()</code> pada array <code>names</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" names = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Tony&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Tania&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Vince&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Terry&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" T = names.filter(\" /><text value=\"element\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" (element[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] === \" /><text value=\"&quot;T&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"));\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(T);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"61\" endIndex=\"73\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'Tony', 'Tania', 'Terry' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>names.filter</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example",
            "id": 115318,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tambahkan deklarasi fungsi inline dan parameter yang sesuai untuk mengisi array <code>largeOrder</code> menggunakan <code>.filter()</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" customerTotals = [\" /><text value=\"99\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"56\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"78\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"110\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"29\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"58\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" largeOrder = customerTotals.filter(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"total\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total &gt; \" /><text value=\"80\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"91\" endIndex=\"106\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>function(total)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example",
            "id": 115319,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Periksa parameternya dan lengkapi sintaksnya agar <code>top3</code> menyimpan tiga <code>finishers</code> pertama.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" finishers = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Sarah&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Sally&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Jake&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Alex&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Tori&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" top3 = finishers.filter(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"name, index\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" index &lt; \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(top3);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"124\" endIndex=\"129\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'Sarah', 'Sally', 'Jake' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>index</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question",
            "id": 115383,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Mengapa kita meneruskan fungsi sebagai parameter di dalam <code>.reduce()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Untuk memberi tahu fungsi <code>.reduce()</code> cara menggabungkan elemen array</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Untuk memberi tahu fungsi <code>.reduce()</code> array mana yang akan dimodifikasi</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Untuk memberi tahu fungsi <code>.reduce()</code> elemen mana yang akan disertakan atau dikecualikan</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Untuk memberi tahu fungsi <code>.reduce()</code> cara menggabungkan elemen array.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kamu menjalankan <code>[5, 10, 20].reduce((total, price) =&gt; total + price)</code>. Nilai apa yang dihasilkan?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>35</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>30</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>[5, 10, 20]</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>[10, 20, 40]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>35</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example",
            "id": 115388,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Lengkapi sintaks untuk memanggil fungsi <code>.reduce()</code> pada array <code>cookieOrders</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" cookieOrders = [\" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"21\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total = cookieOrders.reduce(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"prevVal, currVal\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" prevVal + currVal;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(total);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"75\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"71\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>cookieOrders.reduce</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question",
            "id": 115384,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Berapa jumlah minimum parameter yang kita perlukan agar <code>.reduce()</code> dapat berfungsi?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">2</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">3</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">1</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih 2.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Callback total <code>prices</code> hanya menerima <code>total</code>, sehingga tidak dapat membaca harga saat ini. Apa perbaikan terkecil?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Gunakan dua parameter: <code>total</code> berjalan dan <code>price</code> saat ini</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Gunakan tiga parameter karena indeks array wajib</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Tetap gunakan satu parameter karena <code>total</code> otomatis memuat harga saat ini</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Hapus semua parameter karena <code>.reduce()</code> membaca kedua nilai sendiri</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Gunakan dua parameter: <code>total</code> berjalan dan <code>price</code> saat ini.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example",
            "id": 115392,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Buat kode fungsi arrow yang menerima dua parameter ( <code>prev</code> dan <code>curr</code> ) lalu mengembalikan jumlah keduanya.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" sales = [\" /><text value=\"250\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"125\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"465\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" salesTotal = sales.reduce(\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"prev, curr\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" prev + curr);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(salesTotal);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"59\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"65\" /><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"70\" /><option startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option startIndex=\"72\" endIndex=\"74\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"sales\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"75\" endIndex=\"86\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"840\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>(</code>, diikuti oleh <code>prev</code>, lalu <code>,</code>, <code>curr</code>, <code>)</code>, <code>=&gt;</code>, <code>prev + curr</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Beri nama parameter <code>prev</code> dan <code>curr</code>, sesuai urutan. Buat fungsi arrow yang mengembalikan jumlah keduanya.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" sales = [\" /><text value=\"250\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"125\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"465\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" salesTotal = sales.reduce(\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"prev, curr\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" prev + curr);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(salesTotal);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"59\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"65\" /><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"70\" /><option startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option startIndex=\"72\" endIndex=\"74\" /><option startIndex=\"75\" endIndex=\"86\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"prev - curr\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"prev * curr\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"sales\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"840\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>(</code>, diikuti oleh <code>prev</code>, <code>,</code>, <code>curr</code>, <code>)</code>, <code>=&gt;</code>, dan terakhir <code>prev + curr</code>.</p></body></html>",
